title: Start
---
<<declare $gold = 3>>
<<declare $met = false>>
Mika: Welcome to the market. #happy
<<jump shop>>
===
title: shop
---
Mika: What will it be? You have {$gold} gold.
-> Ask about the pies <<once>>
    Mika: Fresh this morning.
    <<set $met = true>>
    <<jump shop>>
-> Buy a pie <<if $gold >= 2>>
    <<set $gold = $gold - 2>>
    Mika: Enjoy it!
    <<jump shop>>
-> Leave
    <<jump goodbye>>

Mika: Hm?
===
title: goodbye
---
<<if $met>>
Mika: Come back for more stories.
<<else>>
Mika: Bye, stranger.
<<endif>>
<<stop>>
===
